    "version": "Public help retrieved 2026-11-03; local explicit policy specialization v1",
    "locator": "Discounted annual cash flows and year-zero equity; background Short et al. 1995 NREL/TP-462-5173. Local illustrative assumptions explicitly documented; not statutory/SAM parameter validation."
  },
